{
  "slug": "dotnet-ecosystem",
  "title": null,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "3cdf1da6-ba9f-4510-b479-8ee506ecb1d8",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 0,
      "data": {
        "title": "CLR: o motor"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "fa9b8bb6-5e8b-41aa-bb12-235637aabf2e",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Common Language Runtime executa IL (Intermediate Language) compilado do C#. Serviços: JIT compilation, garbage collection, type safety, exception handling, reflection, interop nativo. RyuJIT (2015+) é o compilador JIT atual; tiered compilation otimiza hot methods em background. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "10d0d49f-cebc-4723-abcd-a8714c461db0",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 1,
      "data": {
        "title": "Garbage Collector"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "e4bcb2ec-b484-4f53-b380-0d5702cb6b5c",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "xml",
            "code": "<!-- csproj tuning -->\n<PropertyGroup>\n    <ServerGarbageCollection>true</ServerGarbageCollection>\n    <ConcurrentGarbageCollection>true</ConcurrentGarbageCollection>\n    <RetainVMGarbageCollection>true</RetainVMGarbageCollection>\n</PropertyGroup>"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "03cd4070-1248-44f4-a387-beb24d57aba7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Server GC é default em ASP.NET Core — otimizado para throughput em múltiplos cores. GC tem 3 gerações (0/1/2) + LOH. Objetos grandes (>85KB) vão pra LOH e não são realocados (caro). Para reduzir GC pressure em hot path: "
              },
              {
                "text": "ArrayPool",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", "
              },
              {
                "text": "struct",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", "
              },
              {
                "text": "Span<T>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ". "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "29f905ae-d342-41ac-8214-870f66145e41",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 2,
      "data": {
        "title": "Native AOT (.NET 7+)"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "0d617746-5000-4ed9-9568-57ce07fd9afb",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "xml",
            "code": "<PropertyGroup>\n    <PublishAot>true</PublishAot>\n    <InvariantGlobalization>true</InvariantGlobalization>\n    <StripSymbols>true</StripSymbols>\n</PropertyGroup>"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "e79a30c5-c59e-48ad-acef-1e00e7ad3880",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "language": "bash",
            "code": "dotnet publish -c Release -r linux-x64\n# Gera binário nativo único em bin/Release/net9.0/linux-x64/publish/"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "8e489f64-7ad5-4547-86e8-74a205374b5d",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 2,
          "data": {
            "variant": "info",
            "title": "",
            "content": "Use AOT quando startup e imagem Docker importarem (serverless, Lambdas, CLIs). Para APIs grandes com EF Core e reflexão pesada, fique no JIT — AOT pode exigir trabalho extra em trim warnings."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "39377cd0-b9de-44fd-a626-0196a276aaae",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 3,
      "data": {
        "title": "Ready2Run: middle ground"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "209f62e3-8972-4a69-a112-1efca47a5139",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "xml",
            "code": "<PublishReadyToRun>true</PublishReadyToRun>"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "5640802e-d7d5-405d-ba6f-44b21287a14c",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Compila IL para código nativo ahead-of-time, mas mantém fallback JIT. Startup mais rápido que JIT puro sem as restrições de AOT. Boa opção para APIs ASP.NET Core que não comportam AOT completo. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b240767e-b448-4aa4-b76d-fb257e5098cf",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 4,
      "data": {
        "title": "Docker de produção"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "aa636d52-ad6b-4cd3-acae-7fc4705094ca",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "yaml",
            "code": "# Dockerfile multi-stage para app AOT\nFROM mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/sdk:9.0 AS build\nWORKDIR /src\nCOPY . .\nRUN dotnet publish -c Release -r linux-x64 -o /out \\\n    /p:PublishAot=true\n\nFROM mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/runtime-deps:9.0-jammy-chiseled\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY --from=build /out/MyApi ./MyApi\nENTRYPOINT [\"./MyApi\"]"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fb710798-afad-4266-880f-3484ea40c4bf",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "runtime-deps:chiseled",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " é imagem mínima (sem shell, sem gerenciador de pacotes). AOT gera binário estático. Container final fica <60MB. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5d8dd144-7599-447e-8e55-57ea03db319a",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 5,
      "data": {
        "title": "Blazor, MAUI, Aspire (panorama)"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "f8551008-fceb-483f-b0dc-198c47eb0fa8",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "variant": "info",
            "title": "",
            "content": "Blazor: SPA em C# via WebAssembly (client-side) ou Server (SignalR). MAUI: apps mobile/desktop cross-platform unificando Xamarin.Forms. Aspire: orquestração para microservices em .NET (dashboard, service discovery, observability opinado). Não substitui Kubernetes — complementa local dev e composição."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c3d40588-c179-4bc4-8ae9-58dc02c93b25",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 6,
      "data": {
        "title": "Observability padrão"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "8cd751ab-0928-4771-8a08-ce2c5642a605",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "csharp",
            "code": "// OpenTelemetry em 2026\nbuilder.Services.AddOpenTelemetry()\n    .WithTracing(t => t\n        .AddAspNetCoreInstrumentation()\n        .AddHttpClientInstrumentation()\n        .AddEntityFrameworkCoreInstrumentation()\n        .AddOtlpExporter())\n    .WithMetrics(m => m\n        .AddAspNetCoreInstrumentation()\n        .AddRuntimeInstrumentation()\n        .AddOtlpExporter());"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "0e94736d-9226-4d1f-b536-3f5cbadba627",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "variant": "success",
            "title": "",
            "content": ".NET é cidadão first-class em OpenTelemetry. Traces HTTP + DB + custom spans saem com ~10 linhas. Exporta para qualquer backend OTLP (Jaeger, Tempo, Datadog, New Relic)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}